From: BlackF1re <55582873+BlackF1re@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 01:20:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm/dsi: mask MSM8226 video blanking FIFO interrupts

SM-T531 incurs hundreds of DSI error IRQs per second with all four HS
lane FIFO-underflow flags. A read-only 20,000-sample, five-second trace
against the MDP5 line counter observes 300 new flag transitions, all in
vertical blanking; none of 17,816 active-line samples has these flags.
The working firmware-owned display masks these four sources.

Qualcomm's DSI controller implementation documents the corresponding
ERR_INT_MASK0 bits as 26, 27, 29 and 30. Add an SoC video-mode mask and
apply it for MSM8226, leaving other controllers and command mode alone.
ACK, PHY, PLL, timeout, command and video MDP FIFO masks are unchanged.
This prevents normal blanking from continually scheduling error work;
it does not change link timings, FIFO status or frame transfer.

Link: https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/msm/+/1e5081e1b29bfbd508533677454a3c2f7cc63702

Signed-off-by: BlackF1re <55582873+BlackF1re@users.noreply.github.com>
---
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_cfg.h b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_cfg.h
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_cfg.h
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_cfg.h
@@ -44,6 +44,8 @@
 struct msm_dsi_config {
 	u32 io_offset;
 	bool force_ahbm_clk;
+	/* Additional error sources to mask in video mode. */
+	u32 video_mode_err_mask;
 	const struct regulator_bulk_data *regulator_data;
 	int num_regulators;
 	const char * const *bus_clk_names;
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_cfg.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_cfg.c
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_cfg.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_cfg.c
@@ -57,6 +57,8 @@
 static const struct msm_dsi_config msm8226_dsi_cfg = {
 	.io_offset = DSI_6G_REG_SHIFT,
 	.force_ahbm_clk = true,
+	/* MSM8226 signals HS FIFO underflow at each video blanking interval. */
+	.video_mode_err_mask = BIT(26) | BIT(27) | BIT(29) | BIT(30),
 	.regulator_data = msm8226_dsi_regulators,
 	.num_regulators = ARRAY_SIZE(msm8226_dsi_regulators),
 	.bus_clk_names = dsi_6g_bus_clk_names,
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_host.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_host.c
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_host.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_host.c
@@ -932,7 +932,10 @@
 	dsi_write(msm_host, REG_DSI_EOT_PACKET_CTRL, data);
 
 	/* allow only ack-err-status to generate interrupt */
-	dsi_write(msm_host, REG_DSI_ERR_INT_MASK0, 0x13ff3fe0);
+	data = 0x13ff3fe0;
+	if (flags & MIPI_DSI_MODE_VIDEO)
+		data |= cfg_hnd->cfg->video_mode_err_mask;
+	dsi_write(msm_host, REG_DSI_ERR_INT_MASK0, data);
 
 	dsi_intr_ctrl(msm_host, DSI_IRQ_MASK_ERROR, 1);
 
